:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Encounter

<<if !_harbourNight or !_harbour.event>>
  <<deadwood-harbour-result>>
<<else>>
  <<switch _harbour.event>>
    <<case 'hostile'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Two drenched, silent figures are prying at a heavy wooden crate with rusted iron hooks, foul black brine dripping steadily from their swollen, grey fingers. At the scrape of your boots, they freeze; their necks creak stiffly as they turn in unison. Beneath rotted cowls, bloodless, waterlogged faces stare through you with milky, dead eyes. "...The cargo... leave what ye carry..." An ice-cold hand lunges out of the fog, clawing for your clothes.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          两具浑身湿透、滴淌着腥黑海水的死寂身影正用生锈的铁钩撬凿一只木箱。听到你的脚步声，他们动作一僵，颈骨发出干涩的轻响，缓缓转过头来。破烂的雨披兜帽下，是一张张浮肿无血的灰白面孔，泛着浑浊白翳的瞳孔在血月下死死锁定了你。“……货……把身上的东西留下来……”一只泛着冻尸寒意的手，无声而迅猛地朝你的衣领抓来！
      <</language>>
    <<case 'chase'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "A live one over there... don't let <<phim>> slip away!" A hollow, waterlogged rasp echoes through the red fog. You spin round to see a towering figure cast down a looted sack, lunging toward you. By the splintered warehouse doors, several more pale shapes raise their heads in eerie unison, milky pupils fixing on you. Heavy, brine-soaked boots pound across the wooden pier, closing in with terrifying speed.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “那儿有个活的……别让<<phim>>跑了！”浓雾深处传来一声沙哑空洞的嘶吼，声音像是含着半口海水。你惊骇回头，只见一道挂满海草的高大身影猛然抛下劫掠的麻袋，大步朝你扑来。货仓破损的木门旁，另外几具惨白的身影也整齐划一地抬起头，空洞的死人眼珠同时转向你。沉重蓄满积水的皮靴狠狠踩踏着潮湿的栈道木板，杂乱而急促地包抄逼近！
      <</language>>
    <<case 'voice'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A dull, sickening thump reverberates through the pier beneath your soles. "...Hold the line... don't let the chest sink..." A hollow whisper gurgles up from the black water under the decking, followed by violent thrashing. Swollen, livid fingers force their way through the narrow plank gaps; another ice-cold hand locks around the edge of the wood, hauling upward with unnatural strength. The timber splinters with a violent crack right beside your boots!
        <<option 'CN'>>
          脚下的栈桥木板下突然传来一阵沉闷骇人的撞击声。“……拽住缆绳……不能让箱子沉下去……”低沉空洞的呢喃伴随着水波翻涌声从码头下方的幽暗深水中传出。几根浮肿发青的死人手指猛地从木板接缝里硬生生挤了出来，另一只冰冷僵硬的铁掌死死扣住边缘向上暴扯，木刺飞溅，脚边的木板伴随着刺耳的脆响当场崩裂！
      <</language>>
    <<case 'lucid'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A lone pirate sits atop an overturned ballast chest, sorting tarnished, verdigris-crusted coins into neat piles with stiff, pale fingers. Foul water seeps steadily from their ragged pea-coat, exuding the freezing chill of the abyss. "...Brought up anything of value from the deep?" A cold, clammy hand covers the nearest stack of silver as lifeless eyes turn to you. "Fair trade... old sea-laws still hold. Lay no hand on what ain't yours."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一名海盗独自坐在一只翻倒的压舱箱上，用僵硬发白的手指将几枚生着绿锈的古钱币分成小堆。黑水顺着破烂的旧外套滴落，周围弥漫着深海泥沼的死冷。“……从水底下摸出什么值钱物什了么？”他将冰冷如冰块的手掌盖在最近的一堆钱币上，抬起毫无生气的白翳眼眸望向你，“拿东西来换……规矩还在，别动不属于你的箱子。”
      <</language>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
  <<if _harbour.event is 'lucid'>>
    <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/ghost-ship.png'>><<lanLink ['Ask about the ship (0:05)', '问问那艘船 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Sailor'>>
      <<pass 5>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>><<set _harbour.spoke to true>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
    <<sneakicon>><<lanLink ['Slip behind the fishing nets (0:02)', '躲进渔网后 (0:02)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Fight'>>
      <<pass 2>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck 'silent'>><<skulduggeryuse>>
        <<set _harbour.scene to $skulduggerysuccess is 1 ? 'evaded' : 'caught'>>
        <<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>><<set _harbour.event to ''>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
    <<runicon>><<lanLink ['Run for the harbour steps (0:02)', '跑向港湾石阶 (0:02)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Fight'>>
      <<pass 2>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<athletics 1>>
        <<set _harbour.scene to currentSkillValue('athletics') gte random(200, 700) ? 'escaped' : 'caught'>>
        <<if _harbour.scene is 'escaped'>><<set _harbour.event to ''>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<athleticsdifficulty 200 700>><br>
    <<icon 'alert.png'>><<lanLink ['Stand your ground', '留下来反抗'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Fight'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave the harbour (0:05)', '离开港湾 (0:05)'] 'Mer Street'>>
  <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to ''>><<pass 5>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Sailor
<<location 'seadocks'>><<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _harbourNight and _harbour.event is 'lucid'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The pirate turns a tarnished coin between stiff fingers, their sunken face entirely devoid of living warmth. "The ship? Wherever there's unplundered salt and gold, she drifts with our bones." They never lift their hollow gaze from the coins. "When the red fog rolls over the breakwater, the tide brings us ashore; when the first pale light of dawn cuts the mist, the sea-curse drags us back into the crushing deep." A splintering crash echoes from the warehouses. The dead sailor offers a bleak, humourless grimace. "Best steer clear of me mates, landlubber. They've only got the blind thirst of the drowned left in 'em, and none of me patience for trade."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      海盗将一枚带锈的银币在僵硬的指间翻转，苍白的面孔没有丝毫活人的血色与体温。“那艘船？只要海上有没捞净的油水，她就载着我们漂去哪儿。”海盗始终垂着眼帘盯着手里的钱币，“血雾漫过防波堤，我们便随潮靠岸搜刮，待到破晓第一道天光撕开迷雾，海底的咒誓就会把我们重新拖回万丈深渊。”货仓那边冷不丁传来一声木门被砸烂的轰鸣，海盗嘴角扯出一抹死寂的冷笑，“趁早离其他人远点，伙计。他们脑子里只剩下撕碎一切活人的饥渴，可没我这闲工夫同你叙旧。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if _harbour.relics gt 0 and !_harbour.exchanged>>
    <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/salvage-trade.png'>><<lanLink ['Trade a recovered trinket for £10 (0:05)', '打捞旧物换£10 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Exchange'>>
      <<pass 5>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and _harbour.event is 'lucid' and _harbour.relics gt 0 and !_harbour.exchanged and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set _harbour.relics -= 1, _harbour.exchanged to true, $money += 1000>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>><<deadwood-harbour-result>><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Step back towards the lamps', '退回灯光下'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour'>>
  <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to ''>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Exchange
<<location 'seadocks'>><<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _harbourNight and _harbour.exchanged>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The pirate scrapes a grime-encrusted fingernail across the salvaged trinket, holding it up against the bloody moonlight. "...Been down in the silt a long age. Still reeks of drowned men's luck." Several ancient, freezing silver coins are slid across the chest toward you. You pocket the coins before releasing the keepsake. The pirate tucks it securely inside their sodden coat, then clamps a pale hand over the remaining piles.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      海盗用生着黑泥的指甲刮了刮旧物的表面，迎着血月的猩红微光仔细端详。“……在海底烂泥里泡了有些年头，还留着那些死人的味道。”几枚刺骨冰凉的旧铸硬币顺着斑驳的箱盖推到你面前。你收好钱，将旧物递过去。海盗将它小心地塞入湿透发潮的内袋深处，灰白的大手重新死死按住余下的钱堆。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>><<deadwood-harbour-result>><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the harbour steps', '返回港湾石阶'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour'>>
  <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to ''>>
<</lanLink>><br>
